{"4375790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spell Circle Mage", "steam_appid": 4375790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Game Centered Around Unique Ritual Circle Combat!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the mage Elana, dodging enemy attacks while placing  circles like a game of chess! When the circles match a skill's required pattern, the skill can be triggered. Multiple matches? All matching skills can be fired at once for explosive, satisfying Combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/a7ec59570c8e524cfc3c5d5ca04aff21.poster.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/a7ec59570c8e524cfc3c5d5ca04aff21.webm?t=1785414127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/a7ec59570c8e524cfc3c5d5ca04aff21.mp4?t=1785414127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In-Run Upgrades Create Diverse Combat Styles!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a stage and pick one of 3 random options (e.g., stat boosts, new skills, damage-amplifying magic item) to power up. Your choices are crucial for survival and unleashing flashy combos in later stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/b18ace6983aa5223fab566a40c0feb6e.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Meta Upgrades Make Runs Easier!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop crystals or gems—spend them in the shop for permanent stat boosts or to unlock more magitech. Challenge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/d101358310d7a4274f07fbbe8e2cfd59.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Endless High-Difficulty Modes for More Gems!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all stages in an area, then push further into tougher versions of the same area—stronger enemies, but way more drops! No difficulty cap for hardcore players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/6ca3e2c81510c08c3b24a95c6b41dabe.avif?t=1785414127\" width=772 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Unlock More Skills for Endless Combo Variety!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mage EXP from runs to rank up and unlock new items/skills. Clearing areas also grants specific skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/6ec569f095c7b2018206928746c58cd5.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1560 height=706 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Game Centered Around Unique Ritual Circle Combat!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the mage Elana, dodging enemy attacks while placing  circles like a game of chess! When the circles match a skill's required pattern, the skill can be triggered. Multiple matches? All matching skills can be fired at once for explosive, satisfying Combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/a7ec59570c8e524cfc3c5d5ca04aff21.poster.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/a7ec59570c8e524cfc3c5d5ca04aff21.webm?t=1785414127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/a7ec59570c8e524cfc3c5d5ca04aff21.mp4?t=1785414127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In-Run Upgrades Create Diverse Combat Styles!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a stage and pick one of 3 random options (e.g., stat boosts, new skills, damage-amplifying magic item) to power up. Your choices are crucial for survival and unleashing flashy combos in later stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/b18ace6983aa5223fab566a40c0feb6e.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Meta Upgrades Make Runs Easier!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop crystals or gems—spend them in the shop for permanent stat boosts or to unlock more magitech. Challenge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/d101358310d7a4274f07fbbe8e2cfd59.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Endless High-Difficulty Modes for More Gems!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all stages in an area, then push further into tougher versions of the same area—stronger enemies, but way more drops! No difficulty cap for hardcore players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/6ca3e2c81510c08c3b24a95c6b41dabe.avif?t=1785414127\" width=772 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Unlock More Skills for Endless Combo Variety!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mage EXP from runs to rank up and unlock new items/skills. Clearing areas also grants specific skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/extras/6ec569f095c7b2018206928746c58cd5.avif?t=1785414127\" width=1560 height=706 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Spell Circle Mage is a 2D adventure game that combines action, puzzle, and roguelite elements. Players control the mage Elana, placing spell circles to unleash magic and defeat enemies!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/6ebdc7679a98db25a9fa5aead96647669e1d13ef/header.jpg?t=1785414127", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/0478a05d3b9e6450086445139e65f35412719420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785414127", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4375790/0478a05d3b9e6450086445139e65f35412719420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785414127", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win